/bin/bash -lc "sed -n '1,260p' CLAUDE.md; sed -n '261,520p' CLAUDE.md; sed -n '521,800p' CLAUDE.md" in /home/lazyinspirit/Projects/prestige-math-library
 succeeded in 0ms:
